Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.19,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}I think it's time to blow this scene
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:12.47,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,250)}Get everybody and their stuff together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:14.99,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.1\fade(250,0)}Okay, three, two, one let's jam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.15,0:02:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A-As you can see, I'm just some old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.41,0:02:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't have\Nany children, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said it was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, was it a customer's?\NI will hold it, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.04,0:02:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna go somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little to early to go to bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an early riser... I sleep too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want a prim and proper life,\NI have just the place for you. {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A hotel where you get three meals\Nand a bodyguard, all for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's impossible\Nwithout a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.65,0:02:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about Hotel Prison,\NTeddy Bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.54,0:02:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not, Spike Spiegel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a popular story among criminals
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,that we never want to be\Ncaught by you, or by Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fulfill my objective!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I took out the ignition pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.97,0:03:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,3 million woolongs,\Ngraciously accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the only bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I love them to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to blow\Nstuff up so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya wanna know? I am giving a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.81,0:03:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ringing a bell of warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, be mindful of what I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy? {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Wyatt Earp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You! Teddy Bomber, serial bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.94,0:04:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that you'd plant\Na bomb here today was easy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,for me to figure out after\Ncalculating your criminal cycles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think that's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a security guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In this day and age, a face means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.63,0:04:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what is the basis of your theory?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,my gut instinct. Yes, inspiration!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I said Teddy Bomber\Nwas that guy, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Giddyup!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A horse, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought something was fishy\Nwhen you said you'd {original: "you would"}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,nab that guy as part of\Nyour foraging trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You used up the food money for\Nall four of us, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.26,0:06:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you use it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.43,0:06:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm lying,\Nexplain this on my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I hear ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The horse I can believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:08.00,Default - Overlap,,0,0,0,,You can? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you have to be more creative\Nthan a cowboy in a cowboy outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if he was dressed like a samurai...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...that would be more plausible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he is... little Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Andy is a guy in the YMCA...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A Christian?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.07,0:06:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. Young Men's Cowboy Association!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Such a thing exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But, he got kicked out soon after joining.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he caused others trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy von de Oniyate...\Nthe noble son of Oniyate Ranch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,123 cases of property damage.\N89 cases of destruction of public property.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Many, many people injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A good match for {\i1}someone{\i0} we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:06:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you he existed! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I hear ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Any reactions? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}None yet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let it explode\Nwith all these people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.83,0:07:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His only target is the building.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's not one for murder.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we can trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guys like him are often concerned{\i0}\N{\i1}with their sense of style.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is the perfect\Nparty to hide yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that a serial\Nbomber is gonna come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell the truth, I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.35,0:07:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is about love and peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How did you know it was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This lead the way to its papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I woulda known in either case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:08:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys just don't quit, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to blow\Nthings up so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I am giving out a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.53,0:08:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, in this world, the root of all evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A horse...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A cowboy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Teddy Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it you over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have no memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We met just yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? I have no recollection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, sir, your horse is an inconvenience...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It does prove rather troublesome\Nfor our other customers... {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! My beloved steed Onyx\Nis no ordinary horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,At times, she sets my troubled mind at ease;\Nat others she is my chess partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:08:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Like horses play chess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter either way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I detest being ignored!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to his sense of style?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down! I'm telling you to calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Love and peace, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a lovely horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to be my escort? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, get behind me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You little!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,In my life, I've never seen such a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,tasteless room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I present you with my\Nspecial Son of a Gun Stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll find it\Nextremely delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... So, why are you a bounty hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so rich, uh, I mean if you\Nhave so much comfort in your life...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why... Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because... it suits me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That feeling a cowboy gets\Nwhen he corners a bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... but you don't have to go after\Nsuch a dangerous bounty, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know why nobody wants\Nto go after Teddy Bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants to get\Na piece of the explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.59,0:12:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we can worry about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I don't worry about things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I set my mind on something,\NI can see nothing else!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've seen this\Npersonality somewhere before...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's lookin' at
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,my reflection, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ch-{\alpha&ff&}Cheers...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ch-Cheers...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, I got a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yippie! A souvenir! A souvenir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.32,0:12:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.03,0:13:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess this is for dinner...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stomach will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But, what about him\Nmakes you so hotheaded?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how similar\Npeople hate each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What part of me is similar to\Nthat shit-headed idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The part that makes\Nyou damn troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Big Shot has already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, the last thing we have to tell{\i0}\N{\i1}you is info about TB, Teddy Bomber.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you believe it? We got a message{\i0}\N{\i1}from him, just for this show!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What? Is that for real?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Um, let's see...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.59,0:13:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Warning. This is for those{\i0}\N{\i1}that have made fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My next job is your last chance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This time, I'll blow {\i0}you{\i1} up{\i0}\N{\i1}as well, like fireworks."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My, my, he doesn't sound calm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"That is, if you know where I will set up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Heh, heh, heh.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:14:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And lastly, I will tell you my true intent—"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whoops! Looks like time is up for us.{\i0}\N{\i1}That's all for today.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry I couldn't read all of it, TB.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, until next time...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good luck!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The next one's in City Hall...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You figured it out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,TB is blowing up tall buildings\Nstarting with the tallest one...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason was {\i1}that{\i0} simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.63,0:14:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?\NI'm getting outta this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pass, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Spike, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.43,0:14:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you have to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.22,0:14:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Late!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! If they think they can get away\Nwith this, they are sorely mistaken...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You alone? {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you take so\Nmuch time to get here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! {extra lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never intended humans as targets!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you guys are different!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys like you deserve—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.07,0:15:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You! It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So you finally remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.78,0:15:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You always— {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You always butt in and get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.59,0:15:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the one that's in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I have both of\Nyou here, I will tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason why I continue to\Nblow buildings up. That is because—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we are going to settle\Nthe score once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! That's {\i1}my{\i0} line!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to what I have to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.79,0:15:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are? Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you guys put some\Neffort into your work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.15,0:16:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to catch him first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.63,0:16:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You guys take me too lightly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That elevator's doors will never open again.{\i0} {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And once it starts moving,{\i0}\N{\i1}that's the end. It will never stop.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,At the top floor, my cute\Nlittle bears will greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the moment that the elevator\Nreaches the top floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, live what little you have{\i0}\N{\i1}of your life left without regret!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Farewell, and good luck.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand... I know how he does things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:17:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I know how he does...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.66,0:17:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This afternoon, I reverted the secret\Nemergency code that had been changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.63,0:17:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I reverted it this afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.35,0:17:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Change after change...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,means it's back to where it started!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.81,0:17:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do, what do we do?! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah, stop, shit, it's too tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You are in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Get outta the way, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell... {9 frames}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\Nthey were brave young men...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, shit! {added this}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They're climbing... those two monkeys...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They like high places.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So they {\i1}are{\i0} similar...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go turn him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.91,0:19:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even deserve\Nto be called a cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.49,0:20:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That was some punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a true cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As of today, I will no longer be a cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This really is a hats-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.11,0:20:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So... what are ya gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.85,0:20:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will no doubt find a new way of life...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, Space Cowboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was only a rich boy's hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His level... no... rank...\Nwas really no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are ya listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.77,0:21:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.99,0:21:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he just wasn't any enemy of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I never had\Nhim in my line of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are ya listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you want to blow\Nstuff up so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give a warning
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,against all the unnecessary waste\Ncreated by capitalism lacking philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Planets that needlessly get colonized.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Media that needlessly get circulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And buildings that are needlessly\Ntall to symbolize all of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And by destroying them,\NI wanted to raise
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.53,0:22:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the question of how\Na true pioneer should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.81,0:22:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.72,0:22:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.23,0:22:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me... Musashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.69,0:22:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Jiroumaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all a waste, wasn't it?
