Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:45.49,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}isn't such a bad life
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.08,0:23:45.49,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}isn't such a bad life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:54.22,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}ichido kiri de owaru nara
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.49,0:23:54.22,ED-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}ichido kiri de owaru nara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:54.22,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\bord3\blur4\3c&H483335&\c&H483335&\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.49,0:23:54.22,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD1C4C5&\blur0.5\fade(250,250)}if it ends after the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.01,0:24:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did you pay close attention\Nto me and my wonderful role?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.02,0:24:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the next episode, the next story...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.88,0:24:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing the preview?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.47,0:24:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, it's time for me, Andy,\Nto have an active role in the story!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.32,0:24:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn on the stage is already over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.21,0:24:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm a space samurai, watch me\Ncompletely crush cowboys left and right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.04,0:24:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not appearing\Nin the show anymore! {left the 2.0 lead-in}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.53,0:24:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Next episode of Cowboy Bebop:\NAndy Strikes Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.21,0:24:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The title is nothing like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.58,0:24:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please look forward to it!
